# Sarenakh sample chat — compiled by samples/build_sample.py into a Telegram Desktop export.
#
# Line formats
#   !chat <name>
#   !start <YYYY-MM-DD>                       day 0 (Tehran time)
#   !user <key> | <display name>
#   !label <LABEL> | lead|decoy | <note>      A-* = Quera College Python course, B-* = blue-cut glasses (Basalam)
#   @@ d<day> <HH:MM> [gap=<lo>-<hi>]        new scene; gap = seconds between its messages
#   [#LABEL ]<who>[>ref]: <text>              ref = ^ (previous in scene) | ^N (N back) | #LABEL
#   ~ join <who>                              service message
# Text: \n = newline, `code`, prefixes [sticker 😂] [photo] [file name.py] [fwd Source] [voice N]

